WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,080
Brother Qiang Brother Qiang

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,240
Coming to receive the goods

3
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:14,380
Brother, you are awesome

4
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:16,020
So many couples are blind again

5
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:17,540
Got up early in the morning

6
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,940
I was just thinking about doing something, Brother Qiang.

7
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:21,820
Yesterday's confrontation has all gone away, right?

8
00:00:22,470 --> 00:00:23,590
Brother, are you joking?

9
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:24,990
That's what my brother is like

10
00:00:25,070 --> 00:00:26,310
Don't say three hundred pounds is blind.

11
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:27,710
Just another three thousand pounds

12
00:00:27,790 --> 00:00:29,310
I can also sell them to you on the same day.

13
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:31,630
Yesterday I sold the 300 kilogram big pair.

14
00:00:31,830 --> 00:00:35,610
I have made over a hundred dollars and I really want to do that.

15
00:00:35,770 --> 00:00:40,240
Brother Wang, you’re not allowed to make a fortune. That’s not right.

16
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:42,100
Sold to me to a blind man

17
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,220
Standing right in front of me

18
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:44,540
Don't be blind

19
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:45,940
affect future cooperation

20
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:48,020
I won't make a fortune

21
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:50,940
I still have to support you, brother, you eat meat

22
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:52,540
I'll just have some soup with you.

23
00:00:53,430 --> 00:00:54,390
Brother Wang was joking

24
00:00:54,910 --> 00:00:56,070
You have such a big deal

25
00:00:56,230 --> 00:00:57,350
Hire several workers

26
00:00:57,550 --> 00:00:59,070
Collecting tens of thousands of kilograms of seafood every day

27
00:00:59,270 --> 00:01:00,230
I can't compare with you
